WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
The simulated robot begins mapping rooms while the localization error chart records sensor-fusion accuracy.

00:12.000 --> 00:28.000
The robot follows clearance-aware routes, detects dirt and obstacles, and replans between connected rooms.

00:28.000 --> 00:45.000
The occupancy map fills with traversed paths while delayed encoder, IMU, beacon, and LiDAR measurements are replayed in timestamp order.

00:45.000 --> 01:02.000
The robot completes the remaining reachable rooms and routes toward its docking station.

01:02.000 --> 01:13.000
The final map shows the completed traversal, detected obstacles, cleaned dirt, and the robot returned to dock.
